Navigation reconciliation: web /backup resolves to a dedicated .backupRestore route
(pathSegment "backup", System sidebar group) via AppRouteParser's canonical-segment match —
reachable + deep-linkable without displacing other admin pages. MenuCommandCatalog's
navigateCommands() enumerates AppRoute.allCases, so the new route gets a navigate command
automatically (MenuCommandCatalogTests stays green). The generated TeslaSync.xcodeproj is
git-ignored (rebuilt with xcodegen generate).

